OctoMap (algorithms and occupancy semantics)
    The probabilistic occupancy model implemented in
    crates/candi-octomap-node/src/occupancy.rs follows the method described in:

        A. Hornung, K.M. Wurm, M. Bennewitz, C. Stachniss, and W. Burgard,
        "OctoMap: An Efficient Probabilistic 3D Mapping Framework Based on
        Octrees", Autonomous Robots, 2013.

    That code is an independent implementation written for this project from the
    published method; no OctoMap source is vendored into it.

